{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X缺少重点加亮和随音乐时点出现的感受提示，观众不容易一眼抓住关键词，音乐与文字的即时对应也不如 Y。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的重点加亮、短句交替和定时出现的感受词，确实更方便快速扫读，也能呈现更细密的音乐变化。但 X 把人物每一步心理变化的来由、顾虑和前后联系交代得更清楚，尤其是 S05、S06、S11、S13，能让没读过原文的观众真正理解他为什么这样想、为什么这样做。整体听下来，X 更像一段完整、可信的情感经历；Y 的局部感受更丰富，却有些地方堆叠过密，容易让感受词抢过人物故事本身。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3196182b-2863-4ae8-866d-2762dcbf9f97", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T073125508504Z", "elapsed_seconds": 70.875, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T07:32:36.389701+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ce95bb2d01d9ac61a89d6be0b142587ecc8748496eb995ea558fb5b19f2bca34", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\